{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pulsar Crash fuses the white-knuckle gameplay of 2D twin-stick shooters with the competitive spirit of fighting games. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pulsar Crash is a head to head, competitive twin stick shooter in which up to 4 players pilot starships with unique abilities in top-down space battles. The game takes place in a thrilling space-western setting, with an over the top visual style and an electrifying funk/fusion soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eight unique pilots/ships to master!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each ship has a unique ability designed to cater to a full range of different playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eight secondary weapons to choose from!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully select a secondary weapon to pair with your pilot. Collect Pulsar Orbs during the match to use your secondary weapon and unique ship ability! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Five Playable Stages!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stages are divided into multiple \u201cmaps,\u201d with each round taking place on a new map. Each stage is designed around a central easy-to-understand, challenging-to-master mechanic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Ways to Play!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your next game night a hit with frantic 4-player free for all, prove yourself in hyper-competitive head to head local matches, or find opponents from around the world in our Discord server to play over Remote Play with Friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595100?t=1743567460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595100?t=1743567460","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka